# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# The ADU of read-coils-request followed by one byte of the next ADU (0x00).
# The framer consumes exactly the 12 ADU bytes and leaves the extra byte in the buffer.
00 01 00 00 00 06 11 01 00 13 00 13 00
